E('anemic','/əˈniːmɪk/','贫血的；乏力的；缺乏活力的','字面指贫血；比喻时像某件事缺少推动它的力气，显得疲软。','anemia + -ic，词尾 -ia 对应 -ic；英式也写 anaemic。',ANEM+[['英语 anemia → anemic','贫血 → 贫血的；比喻发展为疲弱的']],'anemic growth 可以说经济增长疲弱；an anemic performance 是乏力的表现。比喻义不是真的给经济或演出诊断贫血。','anemic growth；an anemic performance；anemic patients。','weak 较中性普通；anemic 的比喻常带缺少活力、力度不足的评价，语气比 merely slow 更鲜明。',('The study compared anemic participants with a control group.','研究将贫血参与者与对照组作了比较。'),('Sales showed only anemic growth during the quarter.','这一季度销售额的增长十分疲弱。'),sources=['https://www.etymonline.com/word/anemic','https://www.oxfordlearnersdictionaries.com/definition/english/anaemic','https://www.nhlbi.nih.gov/health/anemia']),
